{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221460","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221460","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322146001:1":{"text":"あの、すみません。この町に聖騎士が来ているのですか？","source_cn":"这位先生，请问最近是有圣骑士前来雪松镇吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x410F5EF61BEBA1EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322146002:1":{"text":"ああ、来てるぞ。昨日着いたばかりでな、ええと……そうそう、確かテミシアという女性の騎士殿だ。威風堂々とした姿で、立派な馬に乗っていたぞ！","source_cn":"啊，是的是的！昨天来的，是位叫……呃，对了，名叫特弥希...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87DC0850BBB49EDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322146003:1":{"text":"テミシアさん！きっと今回の事件で、修道院の皆さんの手助けに来たのですね。","source_cn":"竟然是特弥希娅！她一定是来协助白山修道院的圣职者们处理...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E3647A561BE84CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322146004:1":{"text":"それはそうと、聖騎士殿はこの国の生きた屍はカタストロフの手下ではなく、過去にカタストロフと戦った戦士だと言っておったぞ！","source_cn":"也不知道怎么回事，圣骑士大人说咱们白山的那些活死人不是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31F7BC5BC087177F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322146005:1":{"text":"はてさて一体どういうことだ？ワシはもう訳が分からんよ……","source_cn":"艾雅在上，这到底是真的还是假的？！真是把我给弄糊涂了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1489D3E230588EC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322146006:1":{"text":"まあ、考えるだけ無駄だな。聖騎士殿が嘘をつくはずがないしな……","source_cn":"唉，算了，不想了，反正圣骑士大人是不会欺骗我们的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAAFCD97DA14DE40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:塔德乌兹":{"text":"タデウス","source":"塔德乌兹","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}}